index 9c7c6a9f..27b22fea 100644
--- a/Broiler.JS/Broiler.JavaScript.Compiler/Expressions/FastCompiler.VisitBinaryExpression.cs
+++ b/Broiler.JS/Broiler.JavaScript.Compiler/Expressions/FastCompiler.VisitBinaryExpression.cs
